{"id":"giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1","lines":[{"t":3.543,"end":5.679,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"We haven't encountered any upper ranks","de":"Wir haben keine höheren Ränge angetroffen","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/001.mp3"},{"t":6.093,"end":8.541,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Are we still that far from Muzan?","de":"Sind wir noch so weit von Muzan entfernt?","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/002.mp3"},{"t":8.581,"end":10.549,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"I hope the others are alright","de":"Ich hoffe, den anderen geht es gut","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/003.mp3"},{"t":11.44,"end":12.808,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"(slight gasp? you just look back at the crow)","de":"(Leichtes Keuchen? Du schaust einfach zurück auf die Krähe)","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/004.mp3"},{"t":13.406,"end":15.134,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Miss Shinobu...","de":"Fräulein Shinobu...","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/005.mp3"},{"t":15.932,"end":21.26,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"We're going to win this battle. For you. For everyone!","de":"Wir werden diesen Kampf gewinnen. Für dich. Für alle!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/006.mp3"},{"t":22.676,"end":23.9,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"(started gasp)","de":"(begann zu keuchen)","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/007.mp3"},{"t":23.676,"end":25.956,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"That jolt! What was that?","de":"Dieser Ruck! Was war das?","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/008.mp3"},{"t":25.976,"end":27.656,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"M- Mr. Giyu!","de":"M- Herr Giyu!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/009.mp3"},{"t":27.576,"end":30.168,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"Stay there! Keep calm.","de":"Bleib da! Ruhig halten.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/010.mp3"},{"t":29.85,"end":31.074,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"(weary grunt)","de":"(müdes Grunzen)","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/011.mp3"},{"t":31.742,"end":34.07,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Is someone else fighting?","de":"Kämpft jemand anderes?","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/012.mp3"},{"t":34.058,"end":36.554,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Are we about to lose another comrade?","de":"Werden wir bald einen weiteren Kameraden verlieren?","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/013.mp3"},{"t":42.7,"end":46.924,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"No, it's something else. And it's coming this way.","de":"Nein, es ist etwas anderes. Und es kommt auf diese Weise.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/014.mp3"},{"t":46.986,"end":51.882,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[sniff] This... This scent.","de":"[schnüffeln] Dieser... Dieser Duft.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/015.mp3"},{"t":60.359,"end":62.975,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"Above us! Get back, Tanjiro!","de":"Über uns! Komm zurück, Tanjiro!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/016.mp3"},{"t":63.813,"end":65.037,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[grunt]","de":"[grunzen]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/017.mp3"},{"t":66.716,"end":68.972,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Long time no see.","de":"Lange nicht gesehen.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/018.mp3"},{"t":69.967,"end":73.591,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"It's commendable you got this far.","de":"Es ist lobenswert, dass Sie es bis hierher geschafft haben.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/019.mp3"},{"t":73.606,"end":76.87,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Especially for a puny insect.","de":"Besonders für ein kleines Insekt.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/020.mp3"},{"t":77.654,"end":81.014,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Don't you agree, Tanjiro?!","de":"Findest du das nicht auch, Tanjiro?!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/021.mp3"},{"t":80.846,"end":86.51,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[seething] (slight breath in) AKAZA!","de":"[brodelnd] (leicht einatmen) AKAZA!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/022.mp3"},{"t":91.066,"end":92.794,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Hinokami Kagura:","de":"Hinokami Kagura:","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/023.mp3"},{"t":93.328,"end":94.792,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Fire Wheel!","de":"Feuerrad!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/024.mp3"},{"t":96.953,"end":98.489,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Go through!","de":"Durchlaufen!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/025.mp3"},{"t":98.303,"end":101.591,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"If I can't even sever his arm, I'll never sever his head!","de":"Wenn ich ihm nicht einmal den Arm abtrennen kann, werde ich ihm niemals den Kopf abtrennen!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/026.mp3"},{"t":101.353,"end":104.065,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[yelling] (put some effort into trying to cut off his arm)","de":"[schreit] (bemüht sich, ihm den Arm abzuschneiden)","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/027.mp3"},{"t":108.16,"end":109.384,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"I got one.","de":"Ich habe eins bekommen.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/028.mp3"},{"t":109.705,"end":111.961,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"I was able to dodge his attack, too.","de":"Auch ich konnte seinem Angriff ausweichen.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/029.mp3"},{"t":111.914,"end":113.258,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"I can do this!","de":"Ich kann das schaffen!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/030.mp3"},{"t":113.885,"end":117.101,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"I couldn't aim for his head, but this time for sure!","de":"Ich konnte nicht auf seinen Kopf zielen, aber dieses Mal auf jeden Fall!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/031.mp3"},{"t":118.34,"end":121.1,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Hinokami Kagura: Fake Rainbow!","de":"Hinokami Kagura: Falscher Regenbogen!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/032.mp3"},{"t":127.943,"end":136.943,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[panting] (for a long time, ignore Akaza and Giyus lines)","de":"[keuchend] (ignoriere lange Zeit die Zeilen von Akaza und Giyus)","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/033.mp3"},{"t":133.197,"end":135.069,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Huh?","de":"Hä?","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/034.mp3"},{"t":136.043,"end":140.963,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"Tanjiro. You've really sharpened your skills, haven't you?","de":"Tanjiro. Du hast deine Fähigkeiten wirklich geschärft, nicht wahr?","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/035.mp3"},{"t":141.155,"end":145.739,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"It wouldn't be an exaggeration, to say he's at the level of a Hashira now.","de":"Es wäre keine Übertreibung zu sagen, dass er sich jetzt auf dem Niveau eines Hashira befindet.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/036.mp3"},{"t":146.985,"end":151.209,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"To think that he'd do this well against Upper Three.","de":"Zu glauben, dass er das gegen Upper Three gut machen würde.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/037.mp3"},{"t":156.689,"end":161.729,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"That day......I remmeber a boy who felt completely helpless","de":"An diesem Tag... erinnere ich mich an einen Jungen, der sich völlig hilflos fühlte","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/038.mp3"},{"t":161.935,"end":167.815,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"as he collapsed onto the cold snow, begging through tears for his sister's life.","de":"als er im kalten Schnee zusammenbrach und unter Tränen um das Leben seiner Schwester bettelte.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/039.mp3"},{"t":175.528,"end":177.88,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"But you are helpless no longer.","de":"Aber du bist nicht länger hilflos.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/040.mp3"},{"t":177.674,"end":183.938,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"You have the strength to fight not only for your life, but also for what's precious to you","de":"Sie haben die Kraft, nicht nur für Ihr Leben zu kämpfen, sondern auch für das, was Ihnen wertvoll ist","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/041.mp3"},{"t":185.252,"end":189.956,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"'This boy is not weak. Don't insult him.'","de":"„Dieser Junge ist nicht schwach. Beleidige ihn nicht.'","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/042.mp3"},{"t":190.087,"end":194.335,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"I must admit that Kyojuro was right when he said that.","de":"Ich muss zugeben, dass Kyojuro Recht hatte, als er das sagte.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/043.mp3"},{"t":194.448,"end":200.16,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"You are certainly not weak. In fact, I commend you","de":"Du bist sicherlich nicht schwach. Tatsächlich lobe ich Sie","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/044.mp3"},{"t":202.57,"end":205.666,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Technique Development...","de":"Technikentwicklung...","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/045.mp3"},{"t":209.789,"end":213.365,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Now, let's kick things off, shall we?","de":"Jetzt lasst uns loslegen, ja?","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/046.mp3"},{"t":213.19,"end":215.686,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"It's time we had some fun.","de":"Es ist Zeit, dass wir etwas Spaß haben.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/047.mp3"},{"t":217.313,"end":218.537,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[gasp]","de":"[keuch]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/048.mp3"},{"t":219.643,"end":220.867,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"[scoff]","de":"[spotten]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/049.mp3"},{"t":243.802,"end":245.266,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"[exhales sharply]","de":"[atmet scharf aus]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/050.mp3"},{"t":247.893,"end":249.117,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Heh (amused)","de":"Heh (amüsiert)","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/051.mp3"},{"t":251.795,"end":253.307,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[grunt]","de":"[grunzen]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/052.mp3"},{"t":258.046,"end":259.606,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Heh","de":"Heh","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/053.mp3"},{"t":262.051,"end":265.315,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"Water Breathing, Third Form:","de":"Wasseratmung, Dritte Form:","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/054.mp3"},{"t":265.14,"end":266.82,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"Flowing Dance!","de":"Fließender Tanz!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/055.mp3"},{"t":267.775,"end":271.495,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"You're a Water Hashira. How lucky for me!","de":"Du bist ein Wasser-Hashira. Was für ein Glück für mich!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/056.mp3"},{"t":271.358,"end":274.526,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"It's been 50 years since I fought one.","de":"Es ist 50 Jahre her, seit ich gegen einen gekämpft habe.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/057.mp3"},{"t":275.427,"end":277.491,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[grunt]","de":"[grunzen]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/058.mp3"},{"t":281.758,"end":283.726,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Destructive Death:","de":"Zerstörerischer Tod:","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/059.mp3"},{"t":283.282,"end":285.514,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Disorder!","de":"Unordnung!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/060.mp3"},{"t":287.011,"end":290.707,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"Water Breathing, Eleventh Form:","de":"Wasseratmung, Elfte Form:","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/061.mp3"},{"t":290.961,"end":293.097,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"Dead Calm.","de":"Totenstille.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/062.mp3"},{"t":297.142,"end":300.07,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"I've never seen that move before.","de":"Ich habe diesen Schritt noch nie zuvor gesehen.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/063.mp3"},{"t":300.243,"end":304.587,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Perhaps the last Water Hashira I killed never had a chance to use it!","de":"Vielleicht hatte der letzte Wasser-Hashira, den ich getötet habe, nie die Chance, ihn zu nutzen!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/064.mp3"},{"t":304.644,"end":306.66,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Hinokami Kagura:","de":"Hinokami Kagura:","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/065.mp3"},{"t":306.538,"end":308.794,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Raging Sun!","de":"Rasende Sonne!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/066.mp3"},{"t":309.524,"end":311.708,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[gasp] He vanished!","de":"[keuch] Er ist verschwunden!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/067.mp3"},{"t":311.738,"end":313.418,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Behind me!","de":"Hinter mir!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/068.mp3"},{"t":313.374,"end":315.27,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Fake Rain Kagura!","de":"Falscher Regen Kagura!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/069.mp3"},{"t":315.786,"end":320.874,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"Water Breathing, Second Form: Water Wheel.","de":"Wasseratmung, zweite Form: Wasserrad.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/070.mp3"},{"t":322.672,"end":323.896,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[grunt]","de":"[grunzen]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/071.mp3"},{"t":323.902,"end":325.678,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[yells]","de":"[schreit]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/072.mp3"},{"t":325.777,"end":328.657,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[fighting grunts]","de":"[kämpfendes Grunzen]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/073.mp3"},{"t":332.969,"end":335.177,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Hinokami Kagura:","de":"Hinokami Kagura:","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/074.mp3"},{"t":335.111,"end":337.703,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Flame Dance!","de":"Flammentanz!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/075.mp3"},{"t":337.469,"end":339.797,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Destructive Death, Leg Type:","de":"Zerstörerischer Tod, Beintyp:","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/076.mp3"},{"t":339.587,"end":341.747,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Crown Splitter!","de":"Kronensplitter!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/077.mp3"},{"t":341.999,"end":344.879,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"I blocked it with my sword.","de":"Ich habe es mit meinem Schwert blockiert.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/078.mp3"},{"t":344.702,"end":345.926,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[Grunt]","de":"[Grunzen]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/079.mp3"},{"t":348.474,"end":353.586,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"His move barely grazed me and still did this kind of damage?","de":"Seine Bewegung hat mich kaum gestreift und trotzdem so viel Schaden angerichtet?","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/080.mp3"},{"t":354.063,"end":355.287,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[grunt]","de":"[grunzen]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/081.mp3"},{"t":355.163,"end":356.459,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"(grunt again)","de":"(erneut grunzen)","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/082.mp3"},{"t":356.63,"end":359.726,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Heh! How marvelous!","de":"Heh! Wie wunderbar!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/083.mp3"},{"t":361.257,"end":364.953,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"That elegant sword skill you're using is magnificent!","de":"Die elegante Schwertkunst, die du verwendest, ist großartig!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/084.mp3"},{"t":364.625,"end":367.721,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"I must know now. What is your name?","de":"Ich muss es jetzt wissen. Wie heißt du?","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/085.mp3"},{"t":367.531,"end":369.667,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"I want to remember you!","de":"Ich möchte mich an dich erinnern!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/086.mp3"},{"t":371.462,"end":374.87,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"I don't have a name to give to a demon like you.","de":"Ich kann einem Dämon wie dir keinen Namen geben.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/087.mp3"},{"t":374.663,"end":377.687,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"I hate talking, so don't speak to me!","de":"Ich hasse es zu reden, also sprich nicht mit mir!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/088.mp3"},{"t":378.018,"end":379.914,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Is that so?","de":"Ist das so?","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/089.mp3"},{"t":379.669,"end":382.573,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"You're not much for small talk, are you?","de":"Du bist kein großer Freund von Smalltalk, oder?","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/090.mp3"},{"t":382.408,"end":386.728,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Well, I happen to quite enjoy it, so I'll ask you again.","de":"Nun, es gefällt mir sehr gut, deshalb frage ich Sie noch einmal.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/091.mp3"},{"t":386.975,"end":389.039,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"What is your name?","de":"Wie heißt du?","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/092.mp3"},{"t":388.705,"end":393.457,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[grunting]","de":"[grunzt]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/093.mp3"},{"t":392.46,"end":393.684,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"uagh (the start is Akaza's kick grunt so ignore that)","de":"uagh (der Anfang ist Akazas Trittgrunzen, also ignoriere das)","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/094.mp3"},{"t":394.866,"end":398.73,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Destructive Death, Leg Type:","de":"Zerstörerischer Tod, Beintyp:","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/095.mp3"},{"t":398.583,"end":402.303,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Explosive Flurry! (then some attack noises ig) (Also I know it sounds like he said fury but that's what the subtitles say)","de":"Explosiver Wirbel! (dann ein paar Angriffsgeräusche) (Ich weiß auch, dass es sich anhört, als hätte er Fury gesagt, aber genau das sagen die Untertitel.)","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/096.mp3"},{"t":401.92,"end":404.848,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"[grunt]","de":"[grunzen]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/097.mp3"},{"t":404.616,"end":408.24,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[yelling]","de":"[schreit]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/098.mp3"},{"t":408.83,"end":410.054,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"[grunt]","de":"[grunzen]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/099.mp3"},{"t":410.453,"end":411.845,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"[scoff]","de":"[spotten]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/100.mp3"},{"t":412.242,"end":413.466,"chars":[1],"who":"Giyu","text":"[grunt]","de":"[grunzen]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/101.mp3"},{"t":413.293,"end":415.237,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Mr. Giyu!","de":"Herr Giyu!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/102.mp3"},{"t":416.372,"end":419.132,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"I see. That's his name.","de":"Ich verstehe. Das ist sein Name.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/103.mp3"},{"t":418.866,"end":421.074,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Thank you for letting me know.","de":"Vielen Dank, dass Sie mich informiert haben.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/104.mp3"},{"t":420.941,"end":423.341,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[grunting]","de":"[grunzt]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/105.mp3"},{"t":423.763,"end":426.139,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Hinokami Kagura!","de":"Hinokami Kagura!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/106.mp3"},{"t":425.842,"end":427.594,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Destructive Death:","de":"Zerstörerischer Tod:","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/107.mp3"},{"t":427.414,"end":429.238,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Eight layered Demon Core!","de":"Achtschichtiger Dämonenkern!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/108.mp3"},{"t":428.983,"end":431.455,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"Burning Bones, Summer Sun!","de":"Brennende Knochen, Sommersonne!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/109.mp3"},{"t":432.078,"end":434.358,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[grunt 2x]","de":"[2x grunzen]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/110.mp3"},{"t":434.101,"end":435.661,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"AHHHH!","de":"AHHHH!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/111.mp3"},{"t":435.45,"end":436.962,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[grunt]","de":"[grunzen]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/112.mp3"},{"t":437.731,"end":443.971,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[panting]","de":"[keuchend]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/113.mp3"},{"t":445.609,"end":448.297,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Excellent form!","de":"Hervorragende Form!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/114.mp3"},{"t":448.075,"end":452.227,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"To improve this much in such a short time is impressive.","de":"Es ist beeindruckend, in so kurzer Zeit so viel zu verbessern.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/115.mp3"},{"t":451.912,"end":454.216,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"I'll give you my praise.","de":"Ich gebe dir mein Lob.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/116.mp3"},{"t":454.175,"end":458.951,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"It seems obvious to me that Kyojuro must have really inspired you.","de":"Es scheint mir offensichtlich, dass Kyojuro Sie wirklich inspiriert haben muss.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/117.mp3"},{"t":458.683,"end":465.307,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"The night we met, you were merely a weak, mournful child, crumpled on the ground.","de":"In der Nacht, in der wir uns trafen, warst du nur ein schwaches, trauriges Kind, zusammengebrochen auf dem Boden.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/118.mp3"},{"t":464.947,"end":467.755,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Not even worthy of being killed.","de":"Nicht einmal würdig, getötet zu werden.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/119.mp3"},{"t":467.449,"end":469.993,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"But just look at you now!","de":"Aber schau dich jetzt doch mal an!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/120.mp3"},{"t":469.702,"end":473.782,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"This leap in your abilities, it's like you've been reborn.","de":"Dieser Sprung in deinen Fähigkeiten ist, als wärst du wiedergeboren worden.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/121.mp3"},{"t":473.555,"end":476.003,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"My heart won't stop racing.","de":"Mein Herz hört nicht auf zu rasen.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/122.mp3"},{"t":475.769,"end":478.313,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"I'm truly overjoyed!","de":"Ich bin wirklich überglücklich!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/123.mp3"},{"t":478.089,"end":480.369,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"[snickers]","de":"[kichert]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/124.mp3"},{"t":480.213,"end":485.133,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"The night Kyojuro died, I was glad that it happened.","de":"In der Nacht, in der Kyojuro starb, war ich froh, dass es passiert ist.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/125.mp3"},{"t":484.906,"end":487.114,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"[exclaims in disbelief]","de":"[ruft ungläubig aus]","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/126.mp3"},{"t":487.178,"end":491.402,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"How tragic would it have been if he had never gotten any stronger.","de":"Wie tragisch wäre es gewesen, wenn er nie stärker geworden wäre.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/127.mp3"},{"t":491.661,"end":497.085,"chars":[2],"who":"Akaza and Hakuji","text":"Such a stubborn man, not letting go of those worthless values of staying human.","de":"So ein sturer Mann, der die wertlosen Werte des Menschseins nicht aufgibt.","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/128.mp3"},{"t":497.115,"end":500.715,"chars":[0],"who":"Tanjiro","text":"How dare you!","de":"Wie kannst du es wagen!","orig":"scenes/giyu_and_tanjiro_vs_akaza_full_fight_44_teil1/lines/129.mp3"}]}